        "SRC-001438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City project page: single-lot vesting tentative map for condominium purposes and design permit for 93 condominiums in 20 three-story buildings with two- and three-bedroom units, on the former Family RV site; General Plan Mixed Use Flex (7 to 24 units per acre), zoned MU-F. CEQA: Modified Initial Study/15183 checklist.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "DeNova Homes plans: Residence 1, 1,415 sq ft, 2 bed, 3 stories, from $799,900; Residence 2, 1,598 sq ft, 3 bed, from $819,900; Residence 3, 1,800 sq ft, 3 bed, from $859,000. Below-market-rate workforce homes offered through HouseKeys. Community address 91 Lemongrass Lane.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003068"
      ]
    },
